[0.002, "o", "=== http_logviewer: Status Code Highlighting & Terminal Layouts (Phase 06 / Category A) ===\r\n\r\n[1] High-Contrast Background-Colored HTTP Status Badges (Item 01):\r\n  Status 200 -> Badge: [\u001b[42;30m 200 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 200 ]  (OK / Success)\r\n  Status 201 -> Badge: [\u001b[42;30m 201 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 201 ]  (Created)\r\n  Status 301 -> Badge: [\u001b[43;30m 301 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 301 ]  (Moved Permanently)\r\n  Status 302 -> Badge: [\u001b[43;30m 302 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 302 ]  (Found / Redirect)\r\n  Status 400 -> Badge: [\u001b[41;37m 400 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 400 ]  (Bad Request)\r\n  Status 401 -> Badge: [\u001b[45;97m 401 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 401 ]  (Unauthorized)\r\n  Status 403 -> Badge: [\u001b[45;97m 403 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 403 ]  (Forbidden)\r\n  Status 404 -> Badge: [\u001b[41;97;1m 404 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 404 ]  (Not Found (Target Exploit / Probe))\r\n  Status 500 -> Badge: [\u001b[101;97;1m 500 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 500 ]  (Internal Server Error)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Status 502 -> Badge: [\u001b[101;97;1m 502 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 502 ]  (Bad Gateway)\r\n  Status 503 -> Badge: [\u001b[101;97;1m 503 \u001b[0m]  Mono: [ 503 ]  (Service Unavailable)\r\n\r\n[2] Terminal Color Auto-Detection & Environment Policies (Item 02):\r\n  Active TTY Detected:       false\r\n  Auto Mode (TTY=true):      false\r\n  Auto Mode (TTY=false):     false\r\n  ColorModeAlways (forced):  true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ColorModeNever (suppressed):false\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "[3] Monochromatic Fallback Output (--no-color / piped redirection) (Item 03):\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Raw 404 badge stripped:    \" 404 \"\r\n  Plain text 404 badge:      \" 404 \""]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Plain text 200 badge:      \" 200 \"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Plain text 500 badge:      \" 500 \"\r\n\r\n[4] Visitor Intent Category Badges (Item 04):\r\n  Category REAL_USER              -> \u001b[32m[REAL USER]\u001b[0m  Mono: [REAL USER]\r\n  Category VERIFIED_BOT           -> \u001b[36m[GOOD BOT ]\u001b[0m  Mono: [GOOD BOT ]"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n  Category FRIENDLY_CRAWLER       -> \u001b[36m[FRIENDLY ]\u001b[0m  Mono: [FRIENDLY ]\r\n  Category COMMERCIAL_BOT         -> \u001b[33m[SCRAPER  ]\u001b[0m  Mono: [SCRAPER  ]\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Category SUSPICIOUS             -> \u001b[38;5;208m[SUSPICIOUS]\u001b[0m  Mono: [SUSPICIOUS]\r\n  Category BAD_ACTOR_HACKER       -> \u001b[41;97;1m[ HACKER! ]\u001b[0m  Mono: [ HACKER! ]\r\n  Category UNKNOWN                -> \u001b[90m[ UNKNOWN ]\u001b[0m  Mono: [ UNKNOWN ]\r\n\r\n[5] Country Flag & ISO Code Column Formatting (Item 05):\r\n"]
